title: "FA515: Pharmaceutical Physical Chemistry"
abstract: "R and Quarto teaching materials that integrate data science into FA515: Pharmaceutical Physical Chemistry, a 5 ECTS bachelor course in pharmacy at the University of Southern Denmark. Students learn R through physical chemistry topics: an introduction to R, writing in Quarto, reaction kinetics and shelf-life estimation, vapour pressure and the Clausius-Clapeyron equation, and partial derivatives of multivariable functions."
